---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator calls publishSaleResults(claimMerkleRoot, totalTokens, askTokenAddr)
    q_check_auth --> q_error_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_capital: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_capital --> q_error_capital: capitalAlreadyPublished == false
    q_error_capital --> [*]: revert CapitalNotPublished
    q_check_capital --> q_check_results: capitalAlreadyPublished == true
    q_check_results --> q_error_results: resultsAlreadyPublished == true
    q_error_results --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_check_results --> q_check_ask: resultsAlreadyPublished == false
    q_check_ask --> q_error_ask: askTokenAddr == address(0)
    q_error_ask --> [*]: revert InvalidAskToken
    q_check_ask --> q_set_results: askTokenAddr is valid
    q_set_results --> q_emit: askToken = askTokenAddr, claimMerkleRoot = claimMerkleRoot, totalTokensAllocated = totalTokens, resultsAlreadyPublished = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleResultsPublished(claimMerkleRoot, totalTokens, askTokenAddr)

    note right of q_check_capital
        INV-001: Results can only be published after capital is published
        INV-002: askToken is set exactly once during results publication (post-TGE)
        INV-003: Results publication happens exactly once
        INV-004: Ordering: end() -> publishRaisedCapital() -> publishSaleResults()
    end note
